# Every path that is not a real file is the app, which routes it itself.
#
# Without this, a cold load of anything but "/" is a 404 from the host: the
# router only exists once index.html has run, and /listing/<uuid> is exactly
# the URL somebody pastes into a message. 200 rather than a redirect, so the
# address bar still shows the car.
#
# Read by Cloudflare Pages and by Netlify. The nginx equivalent, for serving
# this from the Forge box instead, is deploy/autevo.mk.nginx.conf.
/*    /index.html   200
